  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n g\xF6ze \xE7arpan ilk k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131nda, boydan
    boya \xE7atlam\u0131\u015F bir \"dumortierit ta\u015F\u0131\" duruyor {{isim}}.
    Bu ta\u015F normalde fal sahibinin haf\u0131zas\u0131n\u0131n g\xFC\xE7l\xFC
    oldu\u011Funa i\u015Farettir. Ancak \xE7ok hat\u0131rlamak ve ya\u015Fanm\u0131\u015Fl\u0131klar\u0131
    zihne y\xFCk etmek, sabr\u0131 azalt\u0131r. Sen her ne ya\u015Fad\u0131ysan,
    art\u0131k sabr\u0131n kalmam\u0131\u015F. \u0130\u015Finle ilgili d\u0131\u015Far\u0131da
    m\xFCcadele ederken, hane i\xE7inde de e\u015Fin han\u0131mefendiyle baz\u0131
    s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hissediyorum. Seni
    yoran ve \xE7arp\u0131\u015Ft\u0131ran en b\xFCy\xFCk etken ise ba\u015Fta her
    zaman maddiyat ve \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC \u015Fah\u0131slar olmu\u015F. Telvelerindeki
    4 rakam\u0131, {{ay_+4}} ay\u0131ndan sonra bu anlamda birden bire ferahlayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    i\u015Faret ediyor."
